\/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e4a27bf elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" data-id=\"e4a27bf\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-58e22ba\" data-id=\"58e22ba\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c00d522 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" data-id=\"c00d522\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2f3b44b\" data-id=\"2f3b44b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-adde33d elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-tabs\" data-id=\"adde33d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-tabs.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t        <div data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" id=\"eael-advance-tabs-adde33d\" class=\"eael-advance-tabs eael-tabs-horizontal eael-tab-auto-active \" data-tabid=\"adde33d\">\n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-nav\">\n                <ul class=\"eael-tab-inline-icon\" role=\"tablist\">\n                                            <li id=\"2022-training-microfinance-for-wash-financing\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"2022-training-microfinance-for-wash-financing-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                                                                                                                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >2022: Training Microfinance for Wash Financing<\/span>                            \n                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"2018-events\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"2018-events-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                                                                                                                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >2018 Events<\/span>                            \n                                                    <\/li>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"2022-training-microfinance-for-wash-financing-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"2022-training-microfinance-for-wash-financing-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <h3>JITEGEMEA CREDIT SCHEME<\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A one day training on WaSH financing to enhance the capacity of the organization to strengthen marketing for WaSH products. The purpose of the training was to help the participant understand the concept of Water, sanitation and hygiene, create awareness for the existing market for WaSH products and understand from participants the challenges in marketing the products and likely mitigation.<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The training methodology was interactive as the trainers ensured that knowledge was not only disseminated but accurately perceived and understood by the participants. In order to ensure this, trainers engaged participants in discussions and kept the forum open for feedback, queries and suggestions.<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These discussions and interactive sessions were supported through participatory planning and group discussions.<\/p>\n                    <\/div>\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"2018-events-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"2018-events-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <h3 data-wow-delay=\"ms\">Theme: End Plastic Pollution<\/h3><p><strong>Project Area:<\/strong>\u00a0Kibera informal settlement.<\/p><p>Worked with Women to create awareness on disposal of solid waste and especially \u201cflying toilet\u201d.<\/p><ul><li>Banners and fliers on need for safe disposal<\/li><li>Walk and talk. Visited the areas with un-safe disposal and talked to the community.<\/li><li>Sharing: Speeches from the residents to the partners.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Project Partners:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Nairobi City Water and Sewerage Company,<\/li><li>Kenya Water and Sanitation Network (KEWASNET),<\/li><li>Yaya Center Management<\/li><\/ul><h3 data-wow-delay=\"ms\"><strong>Theme: Nature for Water<\/strong><\/h3><p><strong>Project Area:<\/strong>\u00a0Nairobi<\/p><p><strong>City County:<\/strong>\u00a0Creating water preservation awareness for up-market households through:<\/p><ul><li>Stickers and poster<\/li><li>Engagement with shoppers in Yaya Center shopping mall (One of the biggest malls in Nairobi<\/li><li>Bulk\u00a0 messages to stakeholders<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Project Partners:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Nairobi County Government (Environment and Human Resources Department),<\/li><li>Boredo supplies services (Engineered Waste Management),<\/li><li>Kibera Women empowerment group, Unilever<\/li><\/ul><h3 data-wow-delay=\"ms\">Theme: Beat Plastic Pollution<\/h3><p><strong>Project area: <\/strong>Murang&#8217;a Town \u2013 Cleaning the Murari river<\/p><ul><li>Removing the plastics along the river banks<\/li><li>Planting trees<\/li><li>Creating awareness using a musical band around the town<\/li><li>Engaging primary school children to understand the dangers of plastics<\/li><li>Project Partners:<\/li><li>Muranga County Government, Nema (Murang\u2019a),<\/li><li>Kenya Forest Office (Muranga),<\/li><li>Murang\u2019a Water Company,<\/li><li>Kenya Prisons,<\/li><li>Equity Bank,<\/li><li>Green Planet tree nurseries,<\/li><li>Bustani landscapes,<\/li><li>Caritas (Muranga), and<\/li><li>Mountain fresh dairies.<\/li><\/ul><h3 data-wow-delay=\"ms\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-7218 alignright\" src=\"https:\/\/washvoiceafrica.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/head-plastic-pollution-300x171-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"171\" \/><\/h3><h3 data-wow-delay=\"ms\">Theme: Nature for Water<\/h3><p><strong>Project Area:<\/strong>\u00a0Nairobi<\/p><p><strong>City County:<\/strong>\u00a0Creating water preservation awareness for up-market households through:<\/p><ul><li>Stickers and poster<\/li><li>Engagement with shoppers in Yaya Center shopping mall (One of the biggest malls in Nairobi<\/li><li>Bulk\u00a0 messages to stakeholders<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Project Partners:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Nairobi County Government (Environment and Human Resources Department),<\/li><li>Boredo supplies services (Eng